    {
      "id": "claim_51604691d6b74f8d8be9b5f122c6fb3b",
      "statement": "The allowance is sensitive to scenario weights: a 100% downside weight would give about $20.2 billion ($4.2 billion above reported) and a 100% baseline weight would cut it by about $1.4 billion, holding the overlay constant. These figures reconcile to the model's scenario totals plus the overlay.",
