    {
      "id": "claim_eefab2f294724b31aa52eabacfa32ba9",
      "statement": "MDL-CR-007 is a Tier 1 model owned by Consumer & Wholesale Credit Risk - Allowance Methodology and independently validated by MRGR (last 2025-11-04, next due 2026-11-30). The Allowance Committee approves scenario weights, CECL outputs and overlays each quarter, and the Firmwide Model Risk Committee approves Tier 1 models. The model sits under the SR 11-7-aligned Model Risk Policy.",
