    {
      "id": "claim_437cbfea2ff8455dbefb2275802c9fe1",
      "statement": "The 2025 MRGR validation of MDL-CR-007 raised a medium-severity finding for the lack of an explicit unfunded-commitments model, remediated by an interim overlay, and a low-severity finding on documentation of Card PD elasticity. The workbook excludes unfunded commitments and is described as a simplified pool-level demonstration.",
