      "id": "claim_832005155fb343279b2193b4c62690fc",
      "statement": "CECL inputs come from three upstream APIs: API-10 supplies point-in-time scenario-conditional PD/LGD (separate from through-the-cycle capital parameters), API-11 supplies EAD and remaining life, and API-14 supplies scenario paths and weights. API-09 is only indirect. A breaking change to an upstream API's schema or logic automatically opens a model change review.",
