      "statement": "Migrating the Macroeconomic Scenario API to the strategic data platform cut scenario-load time for the CECL and capital planning models from six hours to under forty minutes. Card PD/LGD pool estimates from API-10 were refreshed in June 2026 and reflected in the Q2 2026 allowance.",
